zpicotls (2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add checked streaming record transmission and authenticated receive.
  * Make outbound publication failures terminal and retain contiguous fast paths.
  * Eliminate capability-probe allocations and redundant handshake copies.
  * Bump the library ABI to 2 for expanded public buffer and AEAD structures.

 -- Huw Rogers <hrogers@kaldron.io>  Sat, 14 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000

zpicotls (1.7-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Bump the minor version to 1.7 for detached vector transmission.
  * Include the Fusion GHASH lane fix and exact receive-buffer sizing.

 -- Huw Rogers <hrogers@kaldron.io>  Tue, 03 Nov 2026 11:16:31 +0000

